# Written hashes and generated manifests must survive a checkout byte for
# byte: a pinned hash taken over CRLF bytes verifies only on the machine that
# produced it. See README.md, "That property has to hold for every hashed
# artifact".
*.json text eol=lf
*.h text eol=lf
*.dot text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf

# Interpreter and test-runner scratch is never evidence.
__pycache__/** -text
.pytest_cache/** -text
